---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Us | Online Stopwatch"
  description="Contact the Online Stopwatch team with website feedback, feature ideas, accessibility concerns, or privacy questions."
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap prose-page">
    <span class="eyebrow">CONTACT US</span>
    <h1>Questions, feedback, and ideas.</h1>
    <p>
      Wearlivo welcomes feedback that helps make Online Stopwatch clearer and
      more useful. Tell us about a feature idea, a timing issue, an
      accessibility concern, or a problem you found on the website.
    </p>
    <h2>Email us</h2>
    <p>
      Send a message to <a href="mailto:hello@wearlivo.com">hello@wearlivo.com</a>.
      Include the page you were using, your browser and device, and the steps
      that led to an issue when reporting a problem. This helps us understand
      and reproduce it.
    </p>
    <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about browser storage, custom setup links, or clearing your
      session data, email the same address with “Privacy” in the subject line.
      You can also review the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Please do not share sensitive information</h2>
    <p>
      Do not include passwords, payment details, identity documents, or private
      lap records in an email. The stopwatch does not require an account, so we
      do not need those details to help with ordinary website feedback.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/">Back to your stopwatch →</a></p>
  </main>
</Layout>
